abstract: >-
  A Streamlit dashboard that queries the Elsevier Scopus API
  for publication metadata, classifies author affiliations
  into Academia, Industry, or Mixed categories using
  keyword-based heuristics, and visualises the distribution
  and trends over publication years using interactive Plotly
  charts.
